<title>USA: U.S. zinc stocks up in March - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. zinc stocks up in March - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. slab zinc stocks held by smelters rose to 7,839 short tons at the end of March from a revised total of 6,908 short tons at the end of February, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Zinc production rose to 21,426 short tons in March from a total of 19,253 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>Shipments from smelters' plants rose to 20,467 short tons in the month from a revised February total of 19,823 short tons.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
